<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72164" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀθόν-η</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fine linen,</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always pl., <i>fine linen cloths,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				7.107
			</span></i> ; of a woman's dress, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀργεννῇσι καλυψαμένη ὀθόνῃσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.141
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				18.595
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀθόναις ἐσταλμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMort.</u>
					3.2
				</span></i>
			 : sg., <i>a cloth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Act.Ap.
				10.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.134
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.795
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> later,
				<i>sails,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεύσεται εἰς ὀθόνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.53.8
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				10.5
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Thyill.
			</span></i>) : sg., <i>sail-cloth, sail,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>JTr.</u>
				46
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>VH</u>
				2.37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in pl., of
			the <i>membranes</i> that enclose the pupil of the eye, <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				84.8
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
